        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi aba omwami owa Isiraeli ne Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio chikholo choosi cha Isiraeli chacha khu Daudi e Heburoni mala bamuboolela bali, “Efwe khuli babaandu be kamafuki kowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biise bibiabira, Saulo nasiili omwami wefwe, niwe owemeelelanga babaandu ba Isiraeli mwiie. Ne Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhuboolela ali, ‘Ewe okhabe omwaayi lundi omwami owe babaandu base Isiraeli.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio basaakhulu boosi ba Isiraeli bacha khu mwami Daudi e Heburoni. Ne Daudi akhola endakaano ne nabo e Heburoni ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Bamuchukhakho kamafura nga omwami owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 2.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ke Ch. 3.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi aba ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kataru narakikha khuuba omwami. Amiia khu miiko kamakhumi kane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiia Yuda ne ali mu Heburoni khu miiko saba ne kimieesi sita. Ne amiia Isiraeli ne Yuda nali mu Yerusalemu khu miiko kamakhumi kataru na kitaru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.63"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh. 15.63",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bakh. 1.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omwami Daudi ne babaandu bewe bacha Yerusalemu khukhwibwaakala Bayebusi ba bamenyangayo. Bayebusi baboolela Daudi bali, “Socha khunyala khukhwingila muno tawe. Akhaba babofu ne baleme banyala bakhukhiingilila.” Bebaasia bali Daudi se anyala engila mu lukoba lwabwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhaba kario Daudi aamba lukoba lwabwe lusire lwa Sayuni, lulwecha lwamanyikhana nga Lukoba lwa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endaalo ng'eneyo Daudi aboolela babaandu bewe ali, “Omundu yesi yesi onyala aula Bayebusi akhoya aniinile khu ngila eye kameechi nio mala ebwaakale babofu ne baleme nibo Daudi abiila.” Liakila lialomekha lili, “Omubofu no muleme se banyala bengila munju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nga amala khutiila lukoba, aalumenyamo ne khulutiuukha lisina ali, “Lukoba lwa Daudi.” Ombakha alubotookhelesia khurakikhira mu maloba ke kimiliinda khucha mukari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Daudi atasa khuuba ne kamaani sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bunyali aba ne naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Hiramu owe Tiro aruma barume be kimilimo khu Daudi. Baba ne kimirongooro kimitarakwa kie khukhwombakha, alala nende babeechi ne babombakhi barumikhira kamabaale, babombakha enju eya Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liakila Daudi amanya ali Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amwimiisie niye nga omwami owa Isiraeli lundi akaliisie bubwami bwewe sikila babaandu bewe Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma we khuuyila Yerusalemu khukhwama Heburoni, Daudi akhwa bakhasi ne khutasakho babaandi nibo aamenyia mu Yerusalemu nga basaale mala asaala babaana basoleeli ne bakhaana babaandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko kamasina ke babaana nibo asaala ne ali mu Yerusalemu: Siamua, Siobabu, Nasani, Solomoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibihari, Elishua, Nefeei, Yafia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisiama, Eliata ne Elifeleti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bukhili khu Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Bafilisiti ne baulila bali Daudi achukhilwekho kamafura khuuba omwami owa Isiraeli, boosi barakikha khumuyiima. Ne kakhali nga Daudi ne aulila lino, acha mu bwikisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafilisiti baba bechile mala basalaaniile mwitooma lia Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi areeba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ali, “Nje nibwaakale Bafilisiti? Ocha khumbelesia bukhili?” Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amukobosia ali, “Yee, cha! Nja khu khuelesia bukhili khu nibo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Daudi aacha e Baali-perasimu ne ebweeneyo niyo aulila Bafilisiti. Aloma ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi abirire mu basiku base nga kameechi kakechuule.” Nio liakila abuundu ao alaangwa bali Baali-perasimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafilisiti nga ne belukha, balekha enyuma bifwaani biabwe, mala Daudi ne babaandu bewe babisuta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Bafilisiti bakobola sie tooma lia Refaimu, basalanila lundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga Daudi areeba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi lundi, amukobosia ali, “Okhabeluungikha tawe. Babotookhelele, mala obebwaakale khukhwichila lubeka lwe kimirongooro kia misorisati. ",
          "type": "text",
