        },
        {
          "text": "Ne noulila chindiri che khukeenda angaaki we kimirongooro, khola khangu. Sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhakhuraangirire khukhwira banamae be Bafilisiti.” ",
          "type": "text",
